<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106382" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>water-pot, pitcher,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				926
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				678
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ec.</u>
				12.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2855.10
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Branchidae</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρίης πέρι δῆρις</span>
			(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφορίτης</span>) <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1767
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ θύραις τὴν
			ὑδρίαν</span> to break the <i>pitcher</i> at the door,
			'there's many a slip 'twixt cup and lip', <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1363a7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>vessel</i> of any kind, e. g. <i>wine-pot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				136
			</span></i>; <i>a pot of money,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Av.</u>
				602
			</span></i> (anap.) (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὑδρίαις γὰρ ἔκειντο
				οἱ θησαυροί</span> Sch. ad loc.(<i><span class="en">
				603
			</span></i>)), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).161
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				100
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. χαλκῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					47.52
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. χρυσῆ, ἀργυρᾶ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.204.35
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρίαι ἄρτων πέντε</span>
				bread-<i>pans,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				155.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>balloting urn,</i> esp. in lawcourts, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1).334.45
			</span></i> (
				Locr.
			, <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				17.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>cinerary urn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phil.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
				29
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>water-clock,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				5.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				325c
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span> in <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
			</span></i> l.c., where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδρείης</span> is
			v.l.]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
